{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swim. Grow. Try again.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/54db3a627d48a79af643ee81fac46327.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/54db3a627d48a79af643ee81fac46327.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/54db3a627d48a79af643ee81fac46327.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Siegeturtle is a cozy idle RPG roguelite about a turtle swimming home through hostile seas. Your turtle moves on its own while companions support you. You upgrade attributes, skills, equipment and push a little further each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A jetpack? A cannon? Why not both? Blast through different biomes with quirky upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/713e0e1b7a055b34b5838d5594021c72.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=546 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/713e0e1b7a055b34b5838d5594021c72.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/713e0e1b7a055b34b5838d5594021c72.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Companions!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit dolphins, unicorns, seals - each granting a unique ability to your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/da3f373806d4c9235262a89e9f076620.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=398 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/da3f373806d4c9235262a89e9f076620.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/da3f373806d4c9235262a89e9f076620.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up your favorite attributes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strength, Agility, Intelligence, or Vitality? Each makes your turtle stronger in different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/9cb53f7681a2463531c8fac71356e16a.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/9cb53f7681a2463531c8fac71356e16a.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/9cb53f7681a2463531c8fac71356e16a.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick skills to fit your playstyle!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow, spend skill points to upgrade your turtle and companions' abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/2855f1a6270f5834f67f3516db787491.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=800 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/2855f1a6270f5834f67f3516db787491.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/2855f1a6270f5834f67f3516db787491.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt for Legendary Equipment!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon bosses to earn new gear. Choose synergies that complement your build - boost gold gain, regen, drop rates, crits and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break down unwanted gear into upgrade materials, raising your summoning level for a better shot at legendary drops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/759a49b6a96a500e73e24d4dea92d3fb.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/759a49b6a96a500e73e24d4dea92d3fb.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/759a49b6a96a500e73e24d4dea92d3fb.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fish for Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your turtle to fish. Sell fish for gold, or hold them for passive stat bonuses.\u00a0Upgrade your imaginary fishing rod to reel rarer fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/c4466795b640c7d6f7b800be815f0363.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/c4466795b640c7d6f7b800be815f0363.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/c4466795b640c7d6f7b800be815f0363.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relax at your personal Home Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when you\u2019re not adventuring, your turtle isn\u2019t idle - time spent away gathers <strong>Dreamsand</strong>, a unique currency earned only through resting or offline progress. Use it to purchase powerful Home upgrades or customize your turtle in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/33f19ba3b82264dccc5f1420eab26dd3.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=558 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/33f19ba3b82264dccc5f1420eab26dd3.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/33f19ba3b82264dccc5f1420eab26dd3.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements aren't just for show - they grant permanent stats to your turtle and allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/588e7fe01d04e7450f8cc8e8db63fdcf.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=382 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/588e7fe01d04e7450f8cc8e8db63fdcf.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/588e7fe01d04e7450f8cc8e8db63fdcf.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ascend and Evolve </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the time is right, reset your journey in a surge of new power. Each ascension grants permanent upgrades to make your turtle faster and stronger than before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/78423e10fc0cd08e898620aede73b79f.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/78423e10fc0cd08e898620aede73b79f.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/78423e10fc0cd08e898620aede73b79f.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959050?t=1757687215","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/7a304ec32de6105e2d2252959a22484529ea01d6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757687215","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/b07283f883df98883d28e8ce9053b3b174502b99/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757687215","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/b07283f883df98883d28e8ce9053b3b174502b99/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757687215","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3960270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swim. Grow. Try again.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/54db3a627d48a79af643ee81fac46327.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/54db3a627d48a79af643ee81fac46327.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/54db3a627d48a79af643ee81fac46327.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Siegeturtle is a cozy idle RPG roguelite about a turtle swimming home through hostile seas. Your turtle moves on its own while companions support you. You upgrade attributes, skills, equipment and push a little further each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A jetpack? A cannon? Why not both? Blast through different biomes with quirky upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/713e0e1b7a055b34b5838d5594021c72.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=546 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/713e0e1b7a055b34b5838d5594021c72.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/713e0e1b7a055b34b5838d5594021c72.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Companions!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit dolphins, unicorns, seals - each granting a unique ability to your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/da3f373806d4c9235262a89e9f076620.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=398 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/da3f373806d4c9235262a89e9f076620.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/da3f373806d4c9235262a89e9f076620.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up your favorite attributes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strength, Agility, Intelligence, or Vitality? Each makes your turtle stronger in different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/9cb53f7681a2463531c8fac71356e16a.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/9cb53f7681a2463531c8fac71356e16a.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/9cb53f7681a2463531c8fac71356e16a.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick skills to fit your playstyle!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow, spend skill points to upgrade your turtle and companions' abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/2855f1a6270f5834f67f3516db787491.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=800 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/2855f1a6270f5834f67f3516db787491.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/2855f1a6270f5834f67f3516db787491.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt for Legendary Equipment!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon bosses to earn new gear. Choose synergies that complement your build - boost gold gain, regen, drop rates, crits and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break down unwanted gear into upgrade materials, raising your summoning level for a better shot at legendary drops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/759a49b6a96a500e73e24d4dea92d3fb.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/759a49b6a96a500e73e24d4dea92d3fb.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/759a49b6a96a500e73e24d4dea92d3fb.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fish for Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your turtle to fish. Sell fish for gold, or hold them for passive stat bonuses.\u00a0Upgrade your imaginary fishing rod to reel rarer fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/c4466795b640c7d6f7b800be815f0363.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/c4466795b640c7d6f7b800be815f0363.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/c4466795b640c7d6f7b800be815f0363.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relax at your personal Home Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when you\u2019re not adventuring, your turtle isn\u2019t idle - time spent away gathers <strong>Dreamsand</strong>, a unique currency earned only through resting or offline progress. Use it to purchase powerful Home upgrades or customize your turtle in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/33f19ba3b82264dccc5f1420eab26dd3.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=558 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/33f19ba3b82264dccc5f1420eab26dd3.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/33f19ba3b82264dccc5f1420eab26dd3.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements aren't just for show - they grant permanent stats to your turtle and allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/588e7fe01d04e7450f8cc8e8db63fdcf.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=382 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/588e7fe01d04e7450f8cc8e8db63fdcf.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/588e7fe01d04e7450f8cc8e8db63fdcf.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ascend and Evolve </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the time is right, reset your journey in a surge of new power. Each ascension grants permanent upgrades to make your turtle faster and stronger than before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/78423e10fc0cd08e898620aede73b79f.poster.avif?t=1757687215\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/78423e10fc0cd08e898620aede73b79f.webm?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/78423e10fc0cd08e898620aede73b79f.mp4?t=1757687215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["YYZ Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/ab547b4cc95a68525092200605e1822ad25957f4/header.jpg?t=1757687215","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257183665,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183665/movie480.mp4?t=1757687213","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183665/movie_max.mp4?t=1757687213"},"name":"Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257183665/617402a02d05fa972fc8ba321128397f959ca3dc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757687213","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183665/movie480_vp9.web